item: u4-l2-tom-radio

card c05
kind: teach
type: explain
scored: 0
title: Cells repair themselves
figure: cell-repair
figure_at: 1

body:
    The answer to the puzzle is repair. Cells are extremely efficient at repairing this kind of damage, and they do it all the time. A small amount of damage is usually put right.

