card c09
kind: teach
type: explain
scored: 0
title: Exposed is not radioactive
figure: passes-through
figure_at: 1

body:
    Being exposed to radiation is not the same as carrying a radioactive source. A person who was exposed is not radioactive. Radiation does not get on or in people.

